    {
      "source": "The default implementation always returns <a href=\"CallableProcessingInterceptor.html#RESULT_NONE\"><code>CallableProcessingInterceptor.RESULT_NONE</code></a>.",
      "translation": "默认实现始终返回 `<a href=\"CallableProcessingInterceptor.html#RESULT_NONE\"><code>CallableProcessingInterceptor.RESULT_NONE</code></a>`。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Registered at the end, after all other interceptors and\ntherefore invoked only if no other interceptor handles the timeout.",
      "translation": "在末尾注册，位于所有其他拦截器之后，因此仅在没有其他拦截器处理超时时才会被调用。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Note that according to RFC 7231, a 503 without a 'Retry-After' header is\ninterpreted as a 500 error and the client should not retry. Applications\ncan install their own interceptor to handle a timeout and add a 'Retry-After'\nheader if necessary.",
      "translation": "注意，根据 RFC 7231，如果没有 'Retry-After' 头部的 503 状态码会被解释为 500 错误，客户端不应重试。应用程序可以安装自己的拦截器来处理超时，并在必要时添加 'Retry-After' 头部。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "<span class=\"description-from-type-label\">Description copied from interface: <code><a href=\"CallableProcessingInterceptor.html#handleTimeout(org.springframework.web.context.request.NativeWebRequest,java.util.concurrent.Callable)\">CallableProcessingInterceptor</a></code></span>",
      "translation": "<span class=\"description-from-type-label\">描述从接口复制：<code><a href=\"CallableProcessingInterceptor.html#handleTimeout(org.springframework.web.context.request.NativeWebRequest,java.util.concurrent.Callable)\">CallableProcessingInterceptor</a></code></span>",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "<code><a href=\"CallableProcessingInterceptor.html#handleTimeout(org.springframework.web.context.request.NativeWebRequest,java.util.concurrent.Callable)\">handleTimeout</a></code> in interface <code><a href=\"CallableProcessingInterceptor.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.web.context.request.async\">CallableProcessingInterceptor</a></code>",
      "translation": "`<code><a href=\"CallableProcessingInterceptor.html#handleTimeout(org.springframework.web.context.request.NativeWebRequest,java.util.concurrent.Callable)\">handleTimeout</a></code>` 接口 `<code><a href=\"CallableProcessingInterceptor.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.web.context.request.async\">CallableProcessingInterceptor</a></code>` 中",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "a concurrent result value; if the value is anything other than\n<a href=\"CallableProcessingInterceptor.html#RESULT_NONE\"><code>CallableProcessingInterceptor.RESULT_NONE</code></a> or <a href=\"CallableProcessingInterceptor.html#RESPONSE_HANDLED\"><code>CallableProcessingInterceptor.RESPONSE_HANDLED</code></a>, concurrent processing\nis resumed and subsequent interceptors are not invoked",
      "translation": "一个并发结果值；如果该值不是<a href=\"CallableProcessingInterceptor.html#RESULT_NONE\"><code>CallableProcessingInterceptor.RESULT_NONE</code></a>或<a href=\"CallableProcessingInterceptor.html#RESPONSE_HANDLED\"><code>CallableProcessingInterceptor.RESPONSE_HANDLED</code></a>，则恢复并发处理，且不会调用后续拦截器。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Invoked from a container thread when the async request times out before\nthe <code>Callable</code> task completes.",
      "translation": "在异步请求超时且 `<code>Callable</code>` 任务未完成时，由容器线程调用。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "<code><a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/Exception.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.lang\">Exception</a></code> - in case of errors",
      "translation": "<code><a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/Exception.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.lang\">Exception</a></code> - 在发生错误时",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "<code>request</code> - the current request",
      "translation": "<code>request</code> - 当前请求",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "<code>task</code> - the task for the current async request",
      "translation": "<code>task</code> - 当前异步请求的任务",
      "count": 1
